{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Content:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo is in beta stage and only contains a slice of the full game: Please feel free to share &amp; provide feedback!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes 4 Game modes: Play as Trapper, Play as Bandit, Offline (both Trapper &amp; Bandit) and Tutorial both Trapper &amp; Bandit) mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite and play with or against your Steam friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes 3 house locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 XP levels to unlock for both Trapper and Bandit*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Bandit Career unlocks: New perks &amp; tools to unlock*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Trapper Career unlocks: New trap combinations to unlock*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PC and Mac Demo version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Please note: Your progression will be reset once the final game will launch!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About The Main Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend your home using inventive boobytraps as the Trapper, or team up as three sneaky Bandits and try to escape with the loot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bandit Trap</strong> is a wild 3v1 online multiplayer game bursting with pranks, physics-driven mayhem, and laugh-out-loud moments\u2014perfect for parties, friends, and family game night.<br> <br>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Trapper_Header_Banner.jpg?t=1748676307\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Trapper_Prepare.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setup tons of boobytraps to defend your house from storming bandits. Use the Trapper Towers to keep watch and strategically place a wide variety of traps hidden in furniture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Trapper_Defend.gif?t=1748676307\" /> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate your traps remotely from Trapper Towers or enter trapped furniture and attack bandits directly for more damage. Knock-out the Bandits to 100% Damage to claim victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Bandit_Header_Banner.jpg?t=1748676307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Bandit_Invade.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategise with your crew, choose the right gear, perks and map out tactics before the match starts. Choose wisely and outsmart the Trapper with the right setup!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Bandit_Loot.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade traps, fight the Trapper and master a huge variety of scanners and tools to loot hidden treasures. Survive the Trapper attacks and find all 10 hidden treasures to claim victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIGHLY DYNAMIC &amp; DESTRUCTIBLE LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/WaterPropagation.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Knockback_Destruction.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The levels in BANDIT TRAP are highly dynamic and destructible\u2014which means no single match will be the same. Blast holes in walls? Check. Propagating water that seeps through cracks to flood rooms? Double check. Turn rooms into ice-rinks? Triple check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More information will be revealed leading up to launch so stay tuned!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732550?t=1748676307","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732550?t=1748676307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/176d399cef23a07e173db21ade67df0dbfd213f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748676307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/176d399cef23a07e173db21ade67df0dbfd213f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748676307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Content:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo is in beta stage and only contains a slice of the full game: Please feel free to share &amp; provide feedback!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes 4 Game modes: Play as Trapper, Play as Bandit, Offline (both Trapper &amp; Bandit) and Tutorial both Trapper &amp; Bandit) mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite and play with or against your Steam friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes 3 house locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 XP levels to unlock for both Trapper and Bandit*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Bandit Career unlocks: New perks &amp; tools to unlock*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Trapper Career unlocks: New trap combinations to unlock*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PC and Mac Demo version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Please note: Your progression will be reset once the final game will launch!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About The Main Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend your home using inventive boobytraps as the Trapper, or team up as three sneaky Bandits and try to escape with the loot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bandit Trap</strong> is a wild 3v1 online multiplayer game bursting with pranks, physics-driven mayhem, and laugh-out-loud moments\u2014perfect for parties, friends, and family game night.<br> <br>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Trapper_Header_Banner.jpg?t=1748676307\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Trapper_Prepare.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setup tons of boobytraps to defend your house from storming bandits. Use the Trapper Towers to keep watch and strategically place a wide variety of traps hidden in furniture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Trapper_Defend.gif?t=1748676307\" /> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate your traps remotely from Trapper Towers or enter trapped furniture and attack bandits directly for more damage. Knock-out the Bandits to 100% Damage to claim victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Bandit_Header_Banner.jpg?t=1748676307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Bandit_Invade.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategise with your crew, choose the right gear, perks and map out tactics before the match starts. Choose wisely and outsmart the Trapper with the right setup!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Bandit_Loot.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade traps, fight the Trapper and master a huge variety of scanners and tools to loot hidden treasures. Survive the Trapper attacks and find all 10 hidden treasures to claim victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIGHLY DYNAMIC &amp; DESTRUCTIBLE LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/WaterPropagation.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/extras/Knockback_Destruction.gif?t=1748676307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The levels in BANDIT TRAP are highly dynamic and destructible\u2014which means no single match will be the same. Blast holes in walls? Check. Propagating water that seeps through cracks to flood rooms? Double check. Turn rooms into ice-rinks? Triple check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More information will be revealed leading up to launch so stay tuned!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","developers":["PICOMY"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2982360","name":"Bandit Trap"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732550/bb9207bde36e513f5f099bf35e3903ce48ad8eee/header.jpg?t=1748676307","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 PICOMY. All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Max and up<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Max and up<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141557,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141557/movie480.mp4?t=1748530758","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141557/movie_max.mp4?t=1748530758"},"name":"Bandit Trap 